# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# COOP/COEP (which SharedArrayBuffer requires) are deliberately NOT set yet. They arrive
# with Pass 3, where multi-site work makes one shared terrain array worth having instead of
# a 4 MB copy per worker. `require-corp` blocks cross-origin subresources that do not opt
# in, and the satellite raster basemap is the likely casualty -- so when the time comes,
# try `credentialless` first and test that layer specifically.
#
#   /*
#     Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
#     Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
